<title>SINGAPORE: KIE in oilfield products venture.</title>
<headline>KIE in oilfield products venture.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keppel Integrated Engineering (KIE) said on Monday it set up a 50-50 venture with Britain's Hunting Oilfield Services International Ltd to support the Southeast Asia oil and gas industry's tubular products and services.</p>
<p>Hunting supplies carbon and chrome steels to the upstream oil and gas industry, Keppel said in a statement.</p>
<p>Keppel Hunting, the new joint venture, will market and provide the tubular threading services. It has manufacturing facilities in Singapore and Vietnam.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
